      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: i said \"maybe\" it could be a \"reward\" for those who get to a certain rank, like to unlock it or something, i mean it would be great to have it at the start, but it would also give people a reason to try to level up to a certain rank",
