  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Recently in this map called \"VERHACK\" (which it's an amazing map, great job at it MakenCat) there is this companion you can get, which is a little floating ball, which you can click to open a special menu, in here you get a few widgets and tools, like a personal light, a mirror, a clock, and a few other things, and i thought it would be nice, or at least very cool to add something similar that can be optional to have, maybe as a reward for those who get to a certain rank of trust, but with the difference you could choose the model to have in this companion, like for example you could put it so you choose the model of \"Navi\" from The legend of Zelda. Obviously this Companion would only be local, only you can see yours and so every other person can only see theirs (this to prevent performance issues with so many companions at once, or at least to give an option to select who's person you'd like to see their companion), and you could spawn it by clicking a \"spawn companion\" button in the main esc menu.",
